2026-09-17 16:37:25,749 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=adjudication data={"argument_id": "33613606-e5e1-4b62-9d89-1e2c06350560", "created_at": "2026-09-17T14:37:25.438725", "failure_effects": ["C avvisar eller ignorerar M:s uppmaning att avst\u00e5, med h\u00e4nvisning till att en S-ledd minoritetsregering (S+MP) med V som budgetst\u00f6d fr\u00e5n oppositionen uppfyller C:s r\u00f6da linje utan att st\u00f6dja Tid\u00f6.", "M:s paket framst\u00e5r som otillr\u00e4ckligt f\u00f6r att bryta d\u00f6dl\u00e4get; talmannens sonderingar f\u00f6rl\u00e4ngs och regeringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir ol\u00f6st.", "M:s offentliga utspel blottl\u00e4gger att Tid\u00f6fyran saknar st\u00f6d fr\u00e5n C, vilket f\u00f6rsvagar paketets trov\u00e4rdighet som passerande alternativ."], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.55, "rationale": "M's action is a feasible self-binding declaration: M can credibly present a Tid\u00f6 four-party package with M as PM candidate and a coherent budget path, and can publicly urge C to abstain. That part is automatic. However, the desired effect's core external consequences\u2014C abstaining, the package becoming the established credible passing alternative, and effective pressure on C\u2014depend on C's choices. The cons correctly identify a credible C alternative: an S-led minority government (S+MP) tolerated by C, with V as budget support from opposition, which keeps V out of government and passes the 175-no-test if V abstains. This undercuts M's claim that the only passing left alternative requires V in government. C's private assumptions reinforce that C will not be pressured into abstaining without a verifiable policy exchange, and that breaking the public no to V/S in government carries a high credibility cost. The Tid\u00f6 four's 173 seats make the package a plausible passing option if C abstains, but C has a viable alternative that achieves C's red line without supporting Tid\u00f6. Residual uncertainty about whether C might still abstain or whether the package becomes the credible default justifies probabilistic mode. Probability 0.55 reflects a modest chance that the proposal shifts the negotiation, but not a strong likelihood given C's credible alternative.", "raw_output": {"failure_effects": ["C avvisar eller ignorerar M:s uppmaning att avst\u00e5, med h\u00e4nvisning till att en S-ledd minoritetsregering (S+MP) med V som budgetst\u00f6d fr\u00e5n oppositionen uppfyller C:s r\u00f6da linje utan att st\u00f6dja Tid\u00f6.", "M:s paket framst\u00e5r som otillr\u00e4ckligt f\u00f6r att bryta d\u00f6dl\u00e4get; talmannens sonderingar f\u00f6rl\u00e4ngs och regeringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir ol\u00f6st.", "M:s offentliga utspel blottl\u00e4gger att Tid\u00f6fyran saknar st\u00f6d fr\u00e5n C, vilket f\u00f6rsvagar paketets trov\u00e4rdighet som passerande alternativ."], "failure_supersedes_effect_ids": ["3195d00a-6848-44a8-a246-0510c19f06c1"], "mode": "probabilistic", "probability": 0.55, "rationale": "M's action is a feasible self-binding declaration: M can credibly present a Tid\u00f6 four-party package with M as PM candidate and a coherent budget path, and can publicly urge C to abstain. That part is automatic. However, the desired effect's core external consequences\u2014C abstaining, the package becoming the established credible passing alternative, and effective pressure on C\u2014depend on C's choices. The cons correctly identify a credible C alternative: an S-led minority government (S+MP) tolerated by C, with V as budget support from opposition, which keeps V out of government and passes the 175-no-test if V abstains. This undercuts M's claim that the only passing left alternative requires V in government. C's private assumptions reinforce that C will not be pressured into abstaining without a verifiable policy exchange, and that breaking the public no to V/S in government carries a high credibility cost. The Tid\u00f6 four's 173 seats make the package a plausible passing option if C abstains, but C has a viable alternative that achieves C's red line without supporting Tid\u00f6. Residual uncertainty about whether C might still abstain or whether the package becomes the credible default justifies probabilistic mode. Probability 0.55 reflects a modest chance that the proposal shifts the negotiation, but not a strong likelihood given C's credible alternative.", "success_effects": ["M har presenterat ett sammanh\u00e5llet Tid\u00f6fyrapaket (M+SD+KD+L) med M som statsministerkandidat och en tydlig budgetv\u00e4g, vilket etablerar paketet som ett reellt f\u00f6rstahandsalternativ i talmannens sonderingar.", "C:s offentliga st\u00e4llningstagande f\u00f6rblir att avst\u00e5 inte \u00e4r aktuellt utan verifierbart sakpolitiskt utbyte; M:s uppmaning att avst\u00e5 skapar ett tydligt ramverk men inget C-\u00e5tagande.", "Regeringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir formellt ol\u00f6st; talmannen forts\u00e4tter sondera med Tid\u00f6fyran som ett av tv\u00e5 huvudsp\u00e5r."], "success_supersedes_effect_ids": []}, "roll": 0.6437534501352119, "success": false, "success_effects": ["M har presenterat ett sammanh\u00e5llet Tid\u00f6fyrapaket (M+SD+KD+L) med M som statsministerkandidat och en tydlig budgetv\u00e4g, vilket etablerar paketet som ett reellt f\u00f6rstahandsalternativ i talmannens sonderingar.", "C:s offentliga st\u00e4llningstagande f\u00f6rblir att avst\u00e5 inte \u00e4r aktuellt utan verifierbart sakpolitiskt utbyte; M:s uppmaning att avst\u00e5 skapar ett tydligt ramverk men inget C-\u00e5tagande.", "Regeringsfr\u00e5gan f\u00f6rblir formellt ol\u00f6st; talmannen forts\u00e4tter sondera med Tid\u00f6fyran som ett av tv\u00e5 huvudsp\u00e5r."], "supersedes_effect_ids": ["3195d00a-6848-44a8-a246-0510c19f06c1"]}
